ients that require it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/19ca06194f4ed81edcf5685b4d3a6bf8.poster.avif?t=1661347139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/19ca06194f4ed81edcf5685b4d3a6bf8.webm?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/19ca06194f4ed81edcf5685b4d3a6bf8.mp4?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>3. Reset when necessary</strong> - If things get messy, use the hourglass to think it over and start again from scratch.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/ee556e6b4692129866799f52c6dc2a33.poster.avif?t=1661347139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/ee556e6b4692129866799f52c6dc2a33.webm?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/ee556e6b4692129866799f52c6dc2a33.mp4?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>4. Summon the ghost</strong> - Complete the ritual and call upon the restless dead.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/3d4878ea607878d681cf35d68c2fd727.poster.avif?t=1661347139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/3d4878ea607878d681cf35d68c2fd727.webm?t=1661347139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/692930/extras/3d4878ea607878d681cf35d68c2fd727.